+The story: the newcomer opens the approval the agent drafted, turns off passport consent to see the approval blocked with the reason, turns it back on and approves. The landlord's window shows the application at once, with the risk reasoning and no salary. The landlord decides, and the employer's dashboard and the newcomer's roadmap move without anyone touching them.
+
+Every window keeps its own person, so the newcomer, landlord and employer can sit side by side.
