+## The surfaces
+
+| Surface | Audience | Highlights |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| Newcomer | The hire, on a phone | Dependency-aware roadmap, document review with a human confirmation gate, agent activity feed with approval cards, trust passport (consent per recipient, revocable) |
+| Employer | HR, the paying customer | Pipeline and blockers, hire detail with the full journey, employer backing, company expansion (setup roadmap and team move), Guard log |
+| Landlord | A property manager | Applications with risk level and a reason for every point, properties, leases, viewings |
