-## Status
+## Limits and what comes next
 
-See [PROGRESS.md](PROGRESS.md).
+- Guard's measured evidence covers its policy decisions on synthetic attacks. End-to-end safety of the agent has not been measured and is the first thing to test next.
+- TAMM and UAE PASS are simulated. A real integration needs agreements and credentials we do not have.
+- State is in memory by design for the demo. A real deployment needs a database and real authentication.
+- Many parties a newcomer must deal with are not on TAMM and have no API. The plan is a browser companion that guides the person through those sites without acting for them; a prototype is on the branch `qa/live-tamm-demo`.
